      "timelineId": "iliad-timeline-wrath",
      "number": 16,
      "title": "Patroclus Enters Battle",
      "synopsis": "Patroclus borrows Achillesâ€™ identity, saves the ships, kills Sarpedon, and exceeds the limit placed upon him.",
      "notes": "Book 16 of the epic.",
      "wordGoal": null
    },
    {
