      "timelineId": "iliad-timeline-wrath",
      "number": 21,
      "title": "Achilles and the River",
      "synopsis": "Achillesâ€™ slaughter provokes Scamander, and a divine battle erupts around his escape from the flood.",
      "notes": "Book 21 of the epic.",
      "wordGoal": null
    },
    {
